l-original) holds the paper's SBE value and indicator means per photo. Paper's analysis: SBE = per-evaluator z-score of the photo's total of the five indicators, averaged per photo; multiple regression of SBE on the five indicators.\",\n      \"rateMin\": 1,\n      \"rateMax\": 7,\n      \"minRateDescription\": \"Very poor (−3)\",\n      \"maxRateDescription\": \"Very good (+3)\",\n      \"isRequired\": true\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"rating\",\n      \"name\": \"overall_coordination\",\n      \"title\": \"Overall coordination: How well the wall, decorated with murals (natural scenery and folk culture) and natural materials (timber and stone), fits the natural environment of the village.\",\n      \"description\": \"One record per photograph: key = photo id A1–A20 as in the paper. Shown to participants as −3 (very poor) … +3 (very good); stored as 1–7 (1 = −3, 4 = 0, 7 = +3), the same coding as the authors' data file. The page source (script id wall-original) holds the paper's SBE value and indicator means per photo. Paper's analysis: SBE = per-evaluator z-score of the photo's total of the five indicators, averaged per photo; multiple regression of SBE on the five indicators.\",\n      \"rateMin\": 1,\n      \"rateMax\": 7,\n      \"minRateDescription\": \"Very poor (−3)\",\n      \"maxRateDescription\": \"Very good (+3)\",\n      \"isRequired\": true\n     }\n    ]\n   }\n  ]\n }\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"wall-original\">[{\"file\": \"A01.jpg\", \"photo\": \"A1\", \"sbe\": -0.573, \"color_richness_mean_1to7\": 5.3, \"visual_effect_mean_1to7\": 5.04, \"cultural_connotation_mean_1to7\": 5.57, \"vegetation_coverage_mean_1to7\": 4.92, \"overall_coordination_mean_1to7\": 5.06}, {\"file\": \"A02.jpg\", \"photo\": \"A2\", \"sbe\": -0.025, \"color_richness_mean_1to7\": 5.67, \"visual_effect_mean_1to7\": 5.34, \"cultural_connotation_mean_1to7\": 6.03, \"vegetation_coverage_mean_1to7\": 5.07, \"overall_coordination_mean_1to7\": 5.13}, {\"